; One variable: `top_level` in the Node2D world walk. A top-level CanvasItem resolves to a null
; parent item and becomes a canvas root, so its transform is canvas space (canvas_item.cpp:565-571,
; and `_enter_canvas`'s "Resolves to nullptr if the node is top_level"). No other fixture sets it
; in the Node2D walk. `unit-control-top-level.tscn` moves it in the Control walk, another walker.

